                "content": "type: search_result\ntitle: Trump Admin Sues California Over Soaring Egg Prices - Newsweek\nurl: \"https://www.newsweek.com/trump-admin-sues-california-over-soaring-egg-prices-2097051\"\ndescription: \"Proposition 12, an initiative backed by California voters in 2018 and implemented in January 2022, outlawed the use of cages for egg-laying hens, sows and calves raised for veal, giving specific requirements of how much space farmers must give ...\"\nage: \"July 10, 2025\"\npage_age: \"July 10, 2025\"\nlanguage: en\nfamily_friendly: true\nprofile_name: Newsweek\nmeta_url_favicon: \"https://imgs.search.brave.com/PyNRakclvDjMYE-KKrT1jXhVbbvMiBF3N-tfeXW1ziw/rs:fit:32:32:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cDovL2Zhdmlj/b25zLnNlYXJjaC5i/cmF2ZS5jb20vaWNv/bnMvZmRjZTU0MTBh/MjZiZTAwZDBhMjdi/M2YzZDUzMTY3ZjA1/ZWQwZThlYWNiY2Y3/NzQ0NjZjYjhmZGYy/MTZhMjhjNi93d3cu/bmV3c3dlZWsuY29t/Lw\"\nthumbnail_src: \"https://imgs.search.brave.com/O_SCzdgGei5U1IuAnQ2avoNhtLiM5LvlsI7NXoZPLZE/rs:fit:200:200:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9hc3Nl/dHMubmV3c3dlZWsu/Y29tL3dwLWNvbnRl/bnQvdXBsb2Fkcy8y/MDI1LzA4LzI2ODAy/MzktZG9uYWxkLXRy/dW1wLWVnZy1wcmlj/ZXMtY2FsaWZvcm5p/YS5qcGc_dz0xNjAw/Jmg9OTAwJnE9ODg\"\nthumbnail_original: \"https://assets.newsweek.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/2680239-donald-trump-egg-prices-california.jpg?w=1600&h=900&q=88\"\nextra_snippets: \"The main reason behind higher egg prices is that supply has shrunk as a direct consequence of the avian flu that broke out in the country in February 2022 and has since wreaked havoc among American flocks. Under federal policy, to prevent the spread of the virus, entire flocks must be culled if even a single infected bird is found on a farm. Cage-free hens proved to be particularly vulnerable to the virus. In 2024, according to NerdWallet, cage-free hens represented almost 60 percent of all bird flu cases for the year, even as they accounted for about a third of egg-laying hens in the U.S.|Lowering the cost of eggs, which spiked in recent years as an avian flu outbreak ravaged American flocks, was one of President Donald Trump's key campaign promises in the lead-up to the 2024 election.|Essentially, the state bans the use of chicken battery farms, a method of intensive egg production where hens are stacked in rows and rows of tiny cages, which restrict their natural movements and can cause the animals high levels of stress and frustration.|Proposition 12, an initiative backed by California voters in 2018 and implemented in January 2022, outlawed the use of cages for egg-laying hens, sows and calves raised for veal, giving specific requirements of how much space farmers must give to their animals.\"\nhash: 60a2dd5ee039a48a\nembed_ref: newsweek.com-4iy\napp_id: web\nskill_id: search",
